Shows the relevant section of the specification alongside the recomputed output. The section reference is preloaded with the example.

Module 7: Warning Generator
Generates warnings for the following conditions:

A change makes a label or statistic inconsistent with the specification.

A change makes a STAG-Discovered label unreachable.

A change makes the effective null atomic or discontinuous.

A change makes the scan family empty.

A change makes the exceedance probability below the resolution of direct Monte Carlo.

